{% liquid
  assign contact_url = pages['podcover-contact'].url | default: '/pages/podcover-contact'
  assign refund_url = pages['refund-policy'].url | default: '/pages/refund-policy'
%}
<section class="pv-returns" aria-labelledby="pv-title-{{ section.id }}">
  <header class="pv-hero"><div><span class="pv-eyebrow">PODCOVER / RETURNS</span><h1 id="pv-title-{{ section.id }}">Returns,<br><em>made clear.</em></h1><p>Changed your mind, or something not quite right? Let’s find the next step.</p></div></header>
  <div class="pv-start"><div><span class="pv-eyebrow">START HERE</span><h2>Need to<br>make a return?</h2></div><div><p>For standard online orders in Denmark and the EU, you have 14 days after receiving your order to tell us you wish to cancel. Then send it back within the following 14 days.</p><p>Email <a href="mailto:podcoverhelp@gmail.com">podcoverhelp@gmail.com</a> or use our contact form with your order number and a clear cancellation request. We will provide return instructions. You do not have to wait for a reply to make a valid cancellation notice.</p><a class="pv-link" href="{{ refund_url }}">Read the full refund policy <svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></a></div></div>
  <div class="pv-steps"><article><span>01</span><h2>Tell us within 14 days</h2><p>Include your order number and the items you wish to return. Contact us first so we can send the correct return instructions and address.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Send it back</h2><p>Return the items within 14 days of notifying us. You pay change-of-mind return postage. Keep your proof of postage; a tracked service is recommended.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Receive your refund</h2><p>Eligible refunds go to your original payment method. We may wait for the goods or proof of return postage, whichever arrives first. See the full policy for timing and delivery-charge refunds.</p></article></div>
  <div class="pv-notes"><article><h2>Inspecting your case</h2><p>You may open ordinary packaging and inspect the case as you would in a shop. Opening the package does not automatically remove your cancellation right. Handling beyond necessary inspection may lead to a deduction for loss in value.</p></article><article><h2>Personalised or faulty?</h2><p>Clearly personalised items can be excluded from change-of-mind returns. Standard colour and model choices are not personalisation. If your case is faulty, damaged, or incorrect, contact us for help; your statutory rights still apply.</p></article></div>
  <div class="pv-contact"><div><span class="pv-eyebrow">WE’RE HERE TO HELP</span><h2>Let’s sort<br>it out.</h2><p>Send us your order number and a short explanation.</p></div><a href="{{ contact_url }}">Contact PodCover <svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"/></svg></a></div>
</section>
<style>
.pv-returns{background:#fff;color:#182c3a}.pv-returns *,.pv-returns *::before,.pv-returns *::after{box-sizing:border-box}.pv-returns a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.pv-returns h1,.pv-returns h2{margin:0;font-family:Manrope,Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.08}.pv-returns h1{font-size:clamp(56px,7vw,100px)}.pv-returns h1 em{font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;color:#397599}.pv-returns p{color:#526575;font-size:15px;line-height:1.85}.pv-eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:24px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;line-height:1.6}.pv-hero{background:#f1f4f8;padding:80px 6%}.pv-hero>div{max-width:1350px;margin:auto}.pv-hero p{max-width:410px;margin:28px 0 0;font-size:16px}.pv-start{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.7fr 1.3fr;gap:10%;max-width:1350px;margin:auto;padding:80px 6%}.pv-start h2{font-size:clamp(36px,4vw,58px)}.pv-start p:first-child{margin-top:0}.pv-link{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:35px;min-height:44px;margin-top:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #182c3a;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.pv-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px;max-width:1350px;margin:auto;padding:10px 6% 80px}.pv-steps article{border-top:1px solid #cbd5dc;padding-top:25px}.pv-steps article>span{display:block;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:12px;color:#526575}.pv-steps h2{font-size:25px}.pv-notes{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;max-width:1190px;margin:0 auto 80px;padding:45px 5%;background:#f1f4f8}.pv-notes h2{font-size:28px}.pv-contact{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:45px;max-width:1350px;margin:auto;padding:0 6% 90px}.pv-contact h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,56px)}.pv-contact>a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;min-height:48px;padding:17px 24px;background:#182c3a;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px;font-weight:700}.pv-returns a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #397599;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:760px){.pv-hero{padding:65px 6%}.pv-returns h1{font-size:clamp(48px,13vw,72px)}.pv-start{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:35px;padding:60px 6%}.pv-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:25px;padding:0 6% 60px}.pv-steps article>span{margin-bottom:15px}.pv-notes{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px;margin:0 6% 60px;padding:35px 8%}.pv-contact{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column;padding-bottom:65px;gap:25px}.pv-contact>a{width:100%}.pv-link{gap:20px;font-size:12px}}
</style>
{% schema %}
{"name":"PodCover returns","settings":[]}
{% endschema %}
